edroom and abducts her, running from the townspeople and finally dying of exhaustion.\n Meanwhile, the police discover a dummy in Cesare's cabinet, while Caligari flees. \nFrancis tracks Caligari to a mental asylum. He is the director! Or is he?","year":1919,"genre":["Silent","Fantasy","Horror","German Expressionism"],"cat":"Filmes","categoryType":"vod","origem":"Filmes Torrent (Studio)","id":"VOD_TOR_2914ZW9PJ99"},"YTN_ES_1B6ALYZ79O7":{"studio":"youtoon/espanhol/numberblocks-espanol-temporada-6-numberblocks-en-espanol","idioma":"es","title":"Numberblocks Español · Temporada 6 - Numberblocks en Español","thumb":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JufjZdJhJuk/hqdefault.jpg","url":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL5Hd0pS7F7zCeZR6kKLcm7qcFsb7mWdq7","desc":"Playlist de Numberblocks Español · 18 vídeos","genre":["Educativos"],"cat":"Desenhos 24H","categoryType":"live","origem":"YouToon · Espanhol","id":"YTN_ES_1B6ALYZ79O7"}}